<% next_school_year = Date.current.month >= 7 ? Date.current.year + 1 : Date.current.year %>
<% school_year_end = Date.new(next_school_year, 6, 24) %>
<% next_monday = Date.current.next_occurring(:monday) %>
<section class="student-workspace" id="student-schedule" data-student-timetable aria-labelledby="student-workspace-title">
  <header class="student-workspace__heading">
    <div><span class="student-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span> TVOJ TEDEN, TVOJA PRAVILA</span><h2 id="student-workspace-title">Moj tedenski urnik</h2><p>Dodaj predmete in naloge. Spremembe se shranijo v brskalnik, ki ga uporabljaš.</p></div>
    <button class="button primary" type="button" data-add-lesson-open>＋ Dodaj predmet</button>
  </header>

  <div class="student-summary" aria-label="Povzetek tvojega načrta">
    <article class="student-summary__card"><span class="student-summary__mark student-summary__mark--blue" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><div><strong data-lesson-count>0</strong><span>predmetov v tednu</span></div></article>
    <article class="student-summary__card"><span class="student-summary__mark student-summary__mark--red" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong data-task-count>0</strong><span>odprtih obveznosti</span></div></article>
    <article class="student-summary__card student-summary__card--deadline"><span class="student-summary__mark student-summary__mark--navy" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><div><strong data-next-deadline>—</strong><span>naslednji rok</span></div></article>
  </div>

  <div class="student-dashboard">
    <section class="student-panel student-schedule" aria-labelledby="student-schedule-title">
      <div class="student-panel__heading"><div><span class="student-section-index">A · TEDENSKI RAZPORED</span><h3 id="student-schedule-title">Predmeti in učilnice</h3></div><button class="student-text-button" type="button" data-add-lesson-open>＋ Dodaj uro</button></div>
      <div class="student-day-filters" role="group" aria-label="Izberi dan za prikaz na manjšem zaslonu">
        <% [['1','Ponedeljek','Pon'],['2','Torek','Tor'],['3','Sreda','Sre'],['4','Četrtek','Čet'],['5','Petek','Pet']].each_with_index do |(value,full,short),index| %><button type="button" data-student-day="<%= value %>" aria-pressed="<%= index.zero? %>"><span><%= short %></span><small><%= full %></small></button><% end %>
      </div>
      <p class="student-demo-note" data-sample-note hidden><strong>Označen primer urnika.</strong> Uredi ga z dejanskimi dnevi in urami svoje šole ali odstrani vzorčne vnose.</p>
      <form class="student-entry-form" data-lesson-form hidden>
        <div class="student-form-heading"><div><span class="student-section-index">NOVI PREDMET</span><h4 data-lesson-form-title>Dodaj predmet v urnik</h4></div><button class="student-icon-button" type="button" data-lesson-cancel aria-label="Zapri obrazec">×</button></div>
        <input type="hidden" name="id">
        <div class="student-form-grid">
          <label>Predmet<input name="subject" maxlength="80" required placeholder="npr. Matematika"></label>
          <label>Dan<select name="day" required><option value="1">Ponedeljek</option><option value="2">Torek</option><option value="3">Sreda</option><option value="4">Četrtek</option><option value="5">Petek</option></select></label>
          <label>Začetek<input name="start" type="time" required value="08:00"></label>
          <label>Konec<input name="end" type="time" required value="08:45"></label>
          <label>Učilnica<input name="room" maxlength="40" placeholder="npr. 12"></label>
          <label>Učitelj ali učiteljica<input name="teacher" maxlength="80" placeholder="Neobvezno"></label>
          <label class="student-color-field">Barva predmeta<select name="color"><option value="blue">Modra</option><option value="red">Rdeča</option><option value="navy">Temno modra</option></select></label>
        </div>
        <div class="student-form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit" data-lesson-save>Shrani predmet</button><button class="button" type="button" data-lesson-cancel>Prekliči</button><output data-lesson-status role="status"></output></div>
      </form>
      <div class="student-schedule-grid" data-schedule-grid aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="student-empty" data-schedule-empty><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span><div><strong>Začni s prvim predmetom</strong><p>Vsaka šola določa svoj razpored. Dodaj dejanske ure, dneve in učilnice iz svojega urnika.</p><button class="button" type="button" data-add-lesson-open>Dodaj prvi predmet</button><button class="student-text-button" type="button" data-load-sample>Prikaži označen primer</button></div></div>
      <div class="student-ics-period"><label>Koledar izvozi od<input type="date" data-ics-from value="<%= Date.current.iso8601 %>"></label><label>do<input type="date" data-ics-until value="<%= school_year_end.iso8601 %>"></label><p>Ure se ponovijo ob delavnikih z upoštevanjem poletnega časa. Šolskih počitnic ne izločimo samodejno, ker se termini razlikujejo.</p></div>
      <div class="student-schedule-actions"><button class="button" type="button" data-print-schedule>Natisni moj teden</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-export-ics>Izvozi urnik in roke v ICS</button></div>
      <p class="student-private-note"><strong>Zasebno po zasnovi.</strong> Urnik in naloge se shranijo samo v tem brskalniku; Koledar365 jih ne pošlje na strežnik.</p>
    </section>

    <aside class="student-side-column">
      <section class="student-panel student-tasks" aria-labelledby="student-tasks-title">
        <div class="student-panel__heading"><div><span class="student-section-index">B · DOMAČE NALOGE IN PREVERJANJA</span><h3 id="student-tasks-title">Kaj je naslednje?</h3></div><span class="student-task-counter" data-task-progress>0 / 0</span></div>
        <form class="student-task-form" data-task-form>
          <label>Obveznost<input name="title" maxlength="120" required placeholder="Npr. ponoviti ulomke"></label>
          <div class="student-form-grid student-form-grid--task">
            <label>Vrsta<select name="kind"><option value="homework">Domača naloga</option><option value="test">Preverjanje znanja</option><option value="project">Projekt</option></select></label>
            <label>Rok<input name="due" type="date" required></label>
            <label>Predmet<input name="subject" maxlength="80" placeholder="Neobvezno"></label>
            <label>Pomembnost<select name="priority"><option value="normal">Običajno</option><option value="high">Pomembno</option></select></label>
          </div>
          <button class="button primary" type="submit">＋ Dodaj obveznost</button><output data-task-status role="status"></output>
        </form>
        <div class="student-task-list" data-task-list aria-live="polite"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="student-panel student-focus" aria-labelledby="student-focus-title">
        <div class="student-panel__heading"><div><span class="student-section-index">C · ZBRAN UČNI ČAS</span><h3 id="student-focus-title">Čas za zbrano učenje</h3></div><span class="student-focus-symbol" aria-hidden="true">25</span></div>
        <p>Izberi eno nalogo, utišaj motnje in delaj v kratkem intervalu.</p>
        <div class="student-focus-clock" data-focus-clock aria-live="off">25:00</div>
        <div class="student-focus-controls"><label class="sr-only" for="focus-length">Dolžina intervala</label><select id="focus-length" data-focus-length><option value="25">25 minut</option><option value="45">45 minut</option></select><button class="button primary" type="button" data-focus-start>Začni</button><button class="button" type="button" data-focus-reset>Ponastavi</button></div>
        <output class="student-focus-status" data-focus-status role="status">Po intervalu si vzemi kratek odmor.</output>
      </section>

      <section class="student-panel student-backup" aria-labelledby="student-backup-title">
        <div><span class="student-section-index">TVOJI PODATKI</span><h3 id="student-backup-title">Shrani kopijo</h3><p>Če zamenjaš brskalnik ali napravo, urnik in obveznosti prenesi s seboj.</p></div>
        <div class="student-backup-actions"><button class="button" type="button" data-student-backup>Prenesi kopijo</button><label class="button student-file-button">Obnovi kopijo<input type="file" data-student-restore accept="application/json,.json"></label></div><output data-backup-status role="status"></output>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="student-print-tools" aria-labelledby="student-print-tools-title">
    <div><span class="student-section-index">TISKANJE IN PRENOS</span><h3 id="student-print-tools-title">Natisni svoj urnik ali izberi obliko</h3><p>Izberi teden med letoma 2027 in 2030, da se predogled in prenesena predloga ujemata z dejanskimi datumi.</p></div>
    <label>Teden za predlogo<input type="date" data-print-week min="2027-01-01" max="2030-12-31" value="2027-01-04"></label>
    <a class="button primary" href="#design-gallery">15 predlog PDF + WebP <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </section>

  <aside class="student-source-note" aria-label="Uradni viri in pomembne informacije">
    <div><span class="student-source-note__stamp" aria-hidden="true">45′</span><p><strong>V osnovni šoli ura pouka traja 45 minut; pouk se ne sme začeti pred 7.30, urnik predmetov pa določi šola. Tudi v srednji šoli ura pouka traja 45 minut, praktično usposabljanje pri delodajalcu pa 60 minut.</strong> Urnik prilagodi svojemu programu in obvestilom šole; ta stran je osebni pripomoček, ne uradni šolski koledar.</p></div>
    <details><summary>Uradni viri za šolsko leto 2026/27</summary><ul><li><a href="https://www.gov.si/teme/o-osnovni-soli/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Osnovna šola: organizacija in šolsko leto · GOV.SI</a></li><li><a href="https://www.gov.si/teme/solski-koledar-za-osnovne-sole/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Koledar za osnovne šole · GOV.SI</a></li><li><a href="https://www.gov.si/teme/solski-koledar-za-srednje-sole/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Koledar za srednje šole · GOV.SI</a></li></ul><p>Termini počitnic, preverjanj in zaključka pouka se razlikujejo glede na šolsko leto, program in v nekaterih primerih regijo. Preveri obvestila svoje šole.</p></details>
  </aside>

  <div class="student-print-only" data-student-print-header><strong>Koledar365 · Moj šolski teden</strong><span data-student-print-range></span></div>
  <output class="student-live-status" data-student-live-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></output>
</section>
